Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirtieth Episode\NThe Phantom Kite
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.18,0:02:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How delightful!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My crown has disappeared!\NQuick, search for it! Find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.78,0:02:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The phantom thief Gilbert?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.90,0:02:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... Yes, yes! He is a strange\Nthief who only targets crowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.82,0:02:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He has never been\Ncaught or seen by anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.50,0:02:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All that is known is that he is
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.62,0:02:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,incredibly agile and strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Majesty, it seems that Gilbert\Nhas been seen around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My God, how I like Gilbert!\NI can't wait to see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.66,0:04:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- But I say... Sapphire!\N- Yes, mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he appeared suddenly\Nin the town next to ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he steal some crowns there too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.54,0:04:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know!\NHe's so fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.58,0:04:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...that you can never know\Nwhere and when he arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.78,0:04:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's said that he wants to remain a thief\Nuntil he has stolen 10 crowns!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange fellow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.34,0:04:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he could also steal\Nmy father and mother's crown!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.26,0:04:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If they steal it from you,\Nyou can put on another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.82,0:04:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we can't. This is part\Nof the Silverland treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was made\Nby a great master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.94,0:04:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Looking at it, it seems\Nlike just an ordinary crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.74,0:04:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you'll have to be\Nvery careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You know well that,\Nif they were to steal the crown from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you would fall into disgrace!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.06,0:04:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but I'll try to be\Nvery careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.82,0:05:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How I love\Nwatching the parades!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.30,0:05:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the phantom thief Gilbert!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone shoot down that kite!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.70,0:06:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll bring you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Give us back the crown!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.42,0:06:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.82,0:07:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon had warned you\Nthat Gilbert would come...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.62,0:07:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...and you let the crown\Nbe stolen so easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.22,0:07:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's shameful! Have you\Nforgotten that the crown...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.10,0:07:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...is the precious\Ntreasure of Silverland?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.70,0:07:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I have imagined that\Nhe would come right from the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It means that, for the\Nmoment, I'll put on another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,For the moment?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.34,0:07:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you perhaps hope the stolen\Ncrown will return on its own?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.50,0:07:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But we don't even\Nknow where it ended up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.14,0:07:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I will search for it myself\Nand I will certainly find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.86,0:07:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Mother, if I don't do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,these two people\Nwill never stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How brave you are,\NPrincess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How long do you think it will take you\Nto find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be a real shame\Nif it took three years!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Three days.\N- Three days?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.50,0:08:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I will get it back in three days.\NAre you satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.10,0:08:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly, Princess Sapphire!\NWe know how brave you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wonderful to hear you say
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...that you will manage to get\Nthe crown back in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But, to actually do it,\Nhow long do you think it will take you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait for\Nthe fourth day to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You were good! But will you manage\Nto get it back in only three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, the thief is a strange\Nfellow, who flies on a kite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.46,0:08:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's impossible to catch him!\N- Then I will fly too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! You intend to fly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a poster\Nfor the circus that has arrived in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I'll go there and have them\Nteach me some acrobatics.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.38,0:08:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop joking, please!\NYou are a Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.46,0:08:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Something like acrobatics...!\N- Well then, Doctor Uranaru,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.74,0:09:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,can you teach me\Nanother way to fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no... There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised to do it in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but there's nothing\Nthat can be done now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!\NThey say that this boy, Trot,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...is able to fly\Non a kite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Uranaru,\Nplease investigate,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,into what Trot was doing\Nwhen the crown was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to play detective too...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.70,0:09:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gilbert's true identity\Ncould be that of Trot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.94,0:09:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And one more thing: we must\Nsucceed in luring Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Lure him?!\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, yes! Yes, yes, I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Uranaru,\Nhave the people warned immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, Gilbert will arrive!\NYou are truly clever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.02,0:10:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! They say that the night after tomorrow\Nthere will be another military parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?! Did they\Nhave to hold it at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said that the crown that was\Nstolen during yesterday's parade...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...is a fake crown, created\Nto deceive the thief Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.78,0:10:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you so!\NIt wasn't possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...that the King would let\Na crown be stolen so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A fake crown...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Trot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.50,0:10:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you ready? It's your turn next! Hurry up!\N- Yes, alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.62,0:10:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Princess Sapphire!\N- Uranaru, well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that Trot was performing\Nhis acrobatics...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...while they were stealing the crown!\NThere are many witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.\NThen he is not Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I have informed the population\Nabout the military parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, thank you!\NThen I'll go to the circus right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.06,0:11:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...and have them teach me\Nhow to fly on a kite!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.18,0:11:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Princess Sapphire!\NWhere are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We only have two days left!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.02,0:11:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bravo!\N- Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, for you, a master\Nof kite flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.10,0:11:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Trot will show you, to start with,\N"Big wave and small wave"!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The next act\Nwill be "Revolution"!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And now pay attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.30,0:12:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Trot will draw for you\Na beautiful picture in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.90,0:12:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo! Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.82,0:12:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're the best!\N- Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.06,0:12:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo! He doesn't even seem\Nlike a human being!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.74,0:12:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the one who would like\Nto learn how to fly on a kite?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.98,0:12:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Please, make me\Nyour pupil!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He showed no sign of surprise\Nat seeing me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.14,0:12:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought,\Nit isn't Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.14,0:12:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You say that, but it's very different\Nfrom riding a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.06,0:13:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Only those who are very brave, quick\Nand skilled can learn to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.10,0:13:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine! Then it seems made\Njust for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,because I am brave,\Nquick and skilled...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.34,0:13:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I'm also strong,\NI'm telling you! So, I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.22,0:13:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,These hands are white and delicate\Nlike those of a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To fly a kite\Nyou need strong hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying something rude!\NThey are thin, but they are strong
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.54,0:13:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then, I'll give you\Na test. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, try up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but it's Prince Sapphire!\NI wonder why he's here...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What could he possibly have come here for?\NAnd what is he doing with Trot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you think you're capable?\N- I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.66,0:14:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- How did it go?\N- Well, pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.38,0:14:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The next one is that! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now you try it.\N- Do I really have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.38,0:14:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like that! You have to let yourself go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Trot, the boss is calling you!\N- Yes, I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.82,0:14:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back. In the\Nmeantime, you practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.02,0:15:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rest while he's away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it? Scoundrel, show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am! I'm sorry\Nfor making you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But what are you doing?\NAren't you practicing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't have time to do\Nit. They tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, someone\Nthrew knives at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.02,0:15:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why are you laughing?\N- If you can't overcome
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...a thing like that, you'll\Nnever be able to fly on a kite!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So the knives\Ndidn't hit their mark, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, here they are!\NI missed the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.66,0:15:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! And that thing,\Nyou have to change it for a bigger one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.66,0:15:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If something like that falls\Non your head, you die immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.02,0:16:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But why do you want to learn\Nto fly on a kite?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.14,0:16:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a reason and I have to learn\Nby tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.58,0:16:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll be able to teach you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.06,0:16:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What is important\Nin kite flying...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.58,0:16:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...is arm strength\Nand a sense of balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.82,0:16:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your left hand\Nis too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.06,0:16:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up, now,\Nand try again! Come on, get up
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.02,0:16:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.94,0:16:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to fall, keep the\Nsame strength in both hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, otherwise\Nyou won't make it by tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.94,0:16:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally learned\Nhow to fly on a kite!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.74,0:17:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight will be\Nthe big moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so good!\NHe learned in just one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Trot, do you know who that is?\N- No. Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sapphire,\Nthe Prince of this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.54,0:17:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!\NAre you sure, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.34,0:17:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, absolutely sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When I went to steal\Nthe crown, I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.78,0:17:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No one, so far, has ever\Nknown that you and I are Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He, however, might find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He used a fake crown and now he's\Norganizing another military parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.18,0:17:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What could he have in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,His goal might be\Nto lure us into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.58,0:17:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will succeed in stealing\Nthe true crown of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.82,0:17:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And now the kite-flying\Nmaster...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.26,0:17:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...will fight\Nagainst his pupil!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.02,0:17:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to the castle\Nand wait for the phantom thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Trot! Trot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s Gilbert!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.66,0:18:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- No, it’s Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.10,0:18:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, my God!\N- Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.54,0:18:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s safe! She’s safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.14,0:18:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you alright, Sapphire?\N- Yes, everything is fine, Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, the time you\Nyourself set will soon arrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Uranaru, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.18,0:18:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you have something\Nstuck to your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- It’s a letter!\N- Read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.82,0:18:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"You dared to make me steal\Nthe false crown,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but tonight I will steal the true one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Signed:\Nthe phantom thief Gilbert."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s from Gilbert! Damn him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve caught you in a trap and we’ll see\Nwho manages to win this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight there will be\Nthe military parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.66,0:19:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How can Gilbert be avoided\Nif he comes down from the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.42,0:19:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s see...\NOh yes, I’ve got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.66,0:19:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very easy to fly!\NWe will be able to fly...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.78,0:19:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...if we fill that bag\Nwith gas! - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be able to get the crown back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.22,0:19:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.70,0:20:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Something strange\Nis descending from the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is, but I'm\Ntelling you to be on your guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.66,0:20:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is! There it\Nis! It's coming! Hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The crown is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Gilbert!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is luminous paint!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gilbert, on guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.74,0:20:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lose your balance,\Nyou will fall, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.66,0:20:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how do you know\Nmy name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Damn it!\N- That crown is fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.86,0:21:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- I used it to catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.42,0:21:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"Revolution"!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,"Revolution"!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.22,0:21:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.14,0:21:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?! You are Trot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you are admirable.\NYou have beaten me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.38,0:21:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do with me what you will!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why on earth did you do\Nsuch a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I will reveal\NGilbert's identity to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There is another Trot?!\NBut it's not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.98,0:21:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, brother!\NWe have been defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.38,0:22:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know: we are twins!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.86,0:22:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,One plays the part of Gilbert\Nand the other provides the alibis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.78,0:22:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,\Nthis is my great invention:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.22,0:22:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,a flying basket\Nfilled with gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.50,0:22:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to catch\Nthe phantom thief Gilbert!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.94,0:22:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes! We've caught him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.10,0:22:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.06,0:22:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, we'd better surrender!\NThey are superior to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.62,0:22:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire caught Gilbert!\NAdmirable! Admirable!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.74,0:22:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, father, this is the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.10,0:22:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.82,0:22:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the guilty one,\Nso forgive my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.50,0:22:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not true!\NI am the only one to blame!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.18,0:22:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him you must forgive!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.22,0:22:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive either of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.90,0:23:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me one thing:\Nwhy do you only steal crowns?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.78,0:23:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there perhaps a specific reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.94,0:23:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past, my father was\Nin the service of a King, as a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.14,0:23:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, by pure chance
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.42,0:23:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,he dropped the King's crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.02,0:23:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He was imprisoned\Nand then executed as punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.10,0:23:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how precious\Nthat crown was,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.82,0:23:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but a man's life\Nis certainly more precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.18,0:23:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,For us, our father was\Nthe most precious thing in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.54,0:23:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.86,0:23:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, they have come\Nto take Gilbert!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.06,0:23:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the one who captured him,\Nso I will punish him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.82,0:23:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He ran away!\NGilbert ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.18,0:23:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.06,0:24:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Gilbert escaped! Catch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.94,0:24:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how precious a crown is,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.22,0:24:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it is nothing\Ncompared to the life of a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.18,0:24:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can understand Gilbert's feelings\Nperfectly well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.94,0:24:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can understand yours, Sapphire.\NBelieve me.
